@Greenlab_HostAddress = http://localhost:5076
@token = paste_jwt_here

### Login (seed: admin@greenlab.local / Admin123!)
POST {{Greenlab_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@greenlab.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

### ESP32 device event (Lab 1, key from seed)
POST {{Greenlab_HostAddress}}/api/devices/1/event
Content-Type: application/json
X-Lab-Device-Key: dev-key-lab-a-change-me

{
  "motionDetected": true,
  "distanceCm": 40,
  "ldrValue": 500,
  "temperatureCelsius": 30,
  "humidity": 45
}

###

### Admin — labs overview
GET {{Greenlab_HostAddress}}/api/admin/labs/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Staff — current labs (teacher@greenlab.local / Teacher123!)
GET {{Greenlab_HostAddress}}/api/staff/me/current-labs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Admin — list labs (CRUD)
GET {{Greenlab_HostAddress}}/api/admin/labs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Admin — create lab
POST {{Greenlab_HostAddress}}/api/admin/labs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lab C",
  "lightThreshold": 2000,
  "tempFanOnThresholdCelsius": 28,
  "cvLabCode": "lab-c"
}

###

### Admin — add weekly sections to lab 1
POST {{Greenlab_HostAddress}}/api/admin/labs/1/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sections": [
    { "dayOfWeek": "Tuesday", "startTime": "10:00:00", "endTime": "12:00:00", "courseName": "Workshop" }
  ]
}

###

### Admin — apply AI timetable (body from analyze-image response.analysis)
POST {{Greenlab_HostAddress}}/api/admin/schedules/apply-analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "createMissingUsers": true,
  "labs": [ { "name": "Lab X" } ],
  "sections": [
    { "labName": "Lab X", "dayOfWeek": "Monday", "startTime": "09:00:00", "endTime": "11:00:00", "courseName": "Course 1" }
  ],
  "staffAssignments": [
    { "personName": "Dr Ahmed", "role": "Teacher", "labName": "Lab X", "dayOfWeek": "Monday", "startTime": "09:00:00", "endTime": "11:00:00" }
  ]
}

###
